{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUplbmdhYnVydS1DdXJzZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"The Jengaburu Curse","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/iHgipGH41inYtE3codIhJ2Rw5aR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y0aU34cjZqVeMteVlNGpKdbUpmF.jpg","description":"A sudden call brings back Priya, a financial analyst from London to Odisha. A series of strange events follow as she sets on the search for her missing father, an activist who was imprisoned for siding with an indigenous tribe. Against the backdrop of bauxite mining, unexplained deaths and displaced tribals, Priya discovers an international nexus connecting various cities and Jengaburu. Why is the small mining town of Jengaburu at the epicentre of this?\n\nRated A · Ended · First aired 9 Aug 2023 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: Studio Next · Network: SonyLIV\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 7/7\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Mystery","Crime","Drama","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUplbmdhYnVydS1DdXJzZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.1","title":"Homecoming","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Priya returns to Odisha from London to identify the body of her missing father, she realises that it does not belong to Das.  However, she discovers that, along with Professor Das, her entire tribe is missing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1XUUVl98hvvDWvK1vYlwRBCh4p0.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGhlLUplbmdhYnVydS1DdXJzZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.2","title":"Missing People","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-08-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After the shocking death of Man Singh, Priya gets an unexpected clue with a few medical files that belonged to Das. The files indicate the spread of a mysterious illness around Jengaburu and Keonjha